DKImagePickerController
DKCamera
DKPhotoGallery

Compiled into the iOS app through file_picker, whose Swift package
resolves DKImagePickerController (branch 4.3.9,
https://github.com/zhangao0086/DKImagePickerController) and, through it,
DKCamera (https://github.com/zhangao0086/DKCamera) and DKPhotoGallery
(https://github.com/zhangao0086/DKPhotoGallery), both from branch
master. Their LICENSE, the same text in all three:

